                            "value": "{\"messages\": [{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a strategic planning assistant. Create concrete, executable plans where every step produces a verifiable result.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Create an execution plan for the following task:\\n\\n## Task\\nAnalyze the following investigation results and create a plan:\\n\\n=== INCIDENT ANALYSIS (from Intent Classifier) ===\\n\\nIncident Summary:\\n- Application: Mobile/Net Banking\\n- Problem Category: application_issue\\n\\nCustomer Identifiers:\\n- ucic: 1061724050\\n- customer_id: 1061724050\\n\\nLLM Analysis:\\n- User Goal: unable to do debit card transaction\\n- Issue Description: unable to do debit card transaction\\n- Problem Summary: The user is unable to perform a debit card transaction.\\n\\nOriginal Description:\\nShort Description: unable to do debit card transcton\\nDescription: unable to do debit card transcton\\n\\nPlease investigate this issue starting with Similarity Search\\nfor similar historic incidents, then check Jaeger traces to\\nunderstand the current error context.\\n\\n\\n=== SIMILARITY SEARCH RESULTS ===\\n# HISTORIC INCIDENT ANALYSIS - SIMILAR CASES TO CURRENT INCIDENT\\n\\n## Current Incident Details:\\n- **UCIC:** 1061724050\\n- **Customer ID:** 1061724050\\n- **Problem Category:** application_issue\\n- **Short Description:** unable to do debit card transcton\\n- **Description:** unable to do debit card transcton\\n\\n---\\n\\n## SIMILAR INCIDENT 1 (68.60% Similarity)\\n**Incident ID:** INC000003706626\\n**Assignment Group:** Optimus BTO Support\\n\\n**Short Description:** cx states that he is unable to do transactions using debit card, getting error as card not supporting\\n\\n**Description:** cx states that he is unable to do transactions using debit card, getting error as card not supporting\\n\\n**Resolution:**\\n- Ticket Resolution Code: Solved (Permanently)\\n- Ticket Resolution Notes: \\\"Please ask customer to re-check now and confirm. If still issue is persisted kindly reopen or raise new ticket and share error screenshot along with latest screenshot and Date, time for further analysis.\\\"\\n\\n**Key Details:**\\n- Card ending with 1220 was verified as active in DCMS\\n- No error found in DCMS logs initially\\n- Required proper logs for further analysis\\n\\n---\\n\\n## SIMILAR INCIDENT 2 (67.28% Similarity)\\n**Incident ID:** INC000005207308\\n**Assignment Group:** Optimus BTO Support\\n\\n**Short Description:** Unable to enable online transaction of debit card\\n\\n**Description:** Unable to enable online transaction of debit card\\n\\n**Resolution:**\\n- Ticket Resolution Code: Solved (Permanently)\\n- Ticket Resolution Notes: \\\"As per logs error occurred due to SFDC dependency. Kindly ask customer to re-try.\\\"\\n\\n**Key Details:**\\n- Root cause: SFDC dependency issue\\n- Solution: Customer asked to re-try the transaction\\n\\n---\\n\\n## SIMILAR INCIDENT 3 (66.99% Similarity)\\n**Incident ID:** INC000006091950\\n**Assignment Group:** N/A\\n\\n**Short Description:** Unable to enable online transactions debit card\\n\\n**Description:** (Empty description)\\n\\n**Resolution:**\\n- Ticket Resolution Code: Solved (Permanently)\\n- Ticket Resolution Notes: \\\"We did the detailed analysis of the issue below are the findings. Issue description: - Unable to enable online transactions debit card. Corrective Action: - As checked no relevant logs observed for debit card, As per attached screenshot 'daily purchase limit exceeded' Please ask customer to re-try\\\"\\n\\n**Key Details:**\\n- No relevant logs observed for debit card\\n- Issue was \\\"daily purchase limit exceeded\\\"\\n- Solution: Ask customer to re-try\\n\\n---\\n\\n## SIMILAR INCIDENT 4 (65.57% Similarity)\\n**Incident ID:** INC000003409377\\n**Assignment Group:** Optimus BTO Support\\n\\n**Short Description:** cm unable to do transactions from debit card\\n\\n**Description:** Cm unable to do transactions since 09-Jan from debit card. Screenshot attaching on mail as unable to do the same in ticket from vpn\\n\\n**Resolution:**\\n- Ticket Resolution Code: Solved (Permanently)\\n- Ticket Resolution Notes: \\\"As we haven't received any update from your end. We can't keep the ticket long pending. Without complete details we are unable to check the exact issue Hence we are closing the ticket. Kindly raise new ticket with complete details.\\\"\\n\\n**Key Details:**\\n- Ticket closed due to incomplete details\\n- Required account number and customer UCIC number to check issue\\n\\n---\\n\\n## SIMILAR INCIDENT 5 (64.66% Similarity)\\n**Incident ID:** INC000004214253\\n**Assignment Group:** Optimus BTO Support\\n\\n**Short Description:** customer is unable to do E com transaction through debit card, i have attached screenshot also\\n\\n**Description:** customer is unable to do E com transaction through debit card, i have attached screenshot also\\n\\n**Resolution:**\\n- Ticket Resolution Code: Solved (Permanently)\\n- Ticket Resolution Notes: \\\"Without complete details we are unable to check the exact issue Hence we are closing the ticket. Kindly raise new ticket/re-open ticket with complete details.\\\"\\n\\n**Key Details:**\\n- No card link found with mentioned UCIC\\n- Required correct details from customer\\n\\n---\\n\\n## SUMMARY OF RESOLUTIONS AND TROUBLESHOOTING STEPS\\n\\n### 1. Common Resolution Approaches:\\n- **Re-check and confirm with customer** - Most common first step\\n- **Ask customer to re-try** - Especially after system issues (SFDC dependency, daily limit exceeded)\\n- **Request error screenshots** - For further analysis\\n- **Verify card status in DCMS** - Check if card is active\\n- **Check transaction logs** - Analyze for errors\\n\\n### 2. Key Information Needed from Customer:\\n- Error screenshot\\n- Date and time of the issue\\n- Account number\\n- Customer UCIC number\\n- Card details (last 4 digits)\\n- Transaction type (online, E-com, etc.)\\n\\n### 3. 